sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser
    participant Visual as Visual Controller
    participant Commands as tank_commands
    participant Broker as Control Broker
    participant Gateway as WebSocket–LoRa Gateway
    participant Radio as LoRa link
    participant Receiver as Robot ESP32 Receiver
    participant Driver as L298N Driver
    participant Motors as Left / Right Motors
    participant Status as tank_status

    Browser->>Visual: POST Forward (HTTPS / REST)
    Visual->>Commands: XADD Forward
    Broker->>Commands: XREAD
    Commands-->>Broker: Forward event
    Broker->>Gateway: Command JSON (WebSocket)
    Gateway->>Radio: Encrypted 16-byte control frame
    par Radio delivery
        Radio->>Receiver: LoRa packet
        Receiver->>Receiver: Decrypt, CRC32, duplicate-sequence check
        Receiver->>Driver: Direction + PWM
        Driver->>Motors: Drive tracks forward
    and Gateway-reported state
        Gateway-->>Broker: Gateway status (WebSocket)
        Broker->>Status: XADD gateway status
        Visual->>Status: XREAD
        Status-->>Visual: Gateway status event
        Visual-->>Browser: Status update (UI WebSocket)
    end
    Note over Gateway,Receiver: No LoRa acknowledgement/uplink from receiver
